<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.312  bln pesos  14 days  31.39  31.25  31.39    2    2</p>
<p>1.313  bln pesos   9 days  31.42  31.31  31.42    2    2</p>
<p>1.313  bln pesos   8 days  31.46  31.45  31.45    2    2</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos   1 days   N/A    N/A   30.91   N/A  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
